00:08:46.240 --> 00:08:46.560
Great.

00:08:46.560 --> 00:08:48.839
So let's talk about some
of the packaging elements.

00:08:49.020 --> 00:08:50.069
There's packaging.

00:08:50.219 --> 00:08:53.370
This can be corrugated
boxes, bubble mailers, poly

00:08:53.370 --> 00:08:54.959
bags, or even envelopes.

00:08:55.290 --> 00:08:56.189
Tissue paper.

00:08:56.390 --> 00:08:58.800
Great for adding a little
extra surprise to the

00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:00.150
