00:09:00.420 --> 00:09:01.219
Fillers.

00:09:01.545 --> 00:09:04.515
Packing peanuts, air
pillows, or even bubble wrap.

00:09:04.845 --> 00:09:07.814
These help to keep the product
safe and snug during transport,

00:09:07.875 --> 00:09:11.295
