00:09:11.505 --> 00:09:12.015
Just saying.

00:09:12.345 --> 00:09:13.125
Stickers.

00:09:13.155 --> 00:09:16.574
This is an easy way to strengthen
your branding identity and

00:09:16.574 --> 00:09:18.224
