00:09:18.785 --> 00:09:20.370
Promotional materials.

00:09:20.790 --> 00:09:25.230
Capitalize on the opportunity
to educate, inspire, or offer

00:09:25.230 --> 00:09:28.890
additional value to your
customers with flyers, coupons

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:30.569
and other stationery elements.

00:09:30.870 --> 00:09:34.590
Custom note from experience,
I can tell you, nothing says

00:09:34.590 --> 00:09:37.199
we appreciate your business
more than a handwritten

00:09:37.199 --> 00:09:38.189
letter to your customer.

00:09:38.849 --> 00:09:41.490
If this is something that is
feasible for your business, it

00:09:41.490 --> 00:09:44.460
really does go a long way in
leaving a positive impression.

00:09:44.790 --> 00:09:45.750
Instructions.

00:09:45.960 --> 00:09:49.350
Never leave your customers guessing
about your product and how to use.

00:09:50.340 --> 00:09:54.000
From food prepping guides to
technical manuals, these are

00:09:54.060 --> 00:09:57.569
always very appreciated by
customers when receiving a package.

00:09:57.960 --> 00:09:58.500
Tape.

00:09:58.800 --> 00:10:02.460
Of course, clear tape is the
popular pick, but many brands

00:10:02.460 --> 00:10:05.250
